      '<h3>Step-by-step</h3>',
      '<ol><li>Open <strong>Research &rarr; Alternative Markets</strong>.</li><li>Select the <strong>Commodities</strong> toggle.</li><li>Use the tabs to focus on a group.</li><li>Open <strong>Kairos Signal</strong> to see weather conditions and events for producing regions.</li><li>Research related equities, such as miners, producers, or ETFs, in Company Research and add them to your watchlist.</li></ol>',
      '<h3>Troubleshooting</h3>',
