      '<h3>Things to know</h3>',
      'Commodities on Ezana are research-only: there is no futures or physical commodity trading. The Export CSV carries the same sample figures as the table. Kairos Signal, by contrast, uses live weather forecast data for its regional charts, so it is the better place to follow conditions as they change.',
      '<p>Next in Research Tools: <a href="/help-center/user/article/crypto-research">Crypto Research Workspace</a> and <a href="/help-center/user/article/economic-indicators">Economic Indicators Dashboard</a>.</p>',
      '<h3>Related articles</h3>',
