      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> When will it open?</p><p>A: It is scheduled for the v1.0 launch. Watch the platform changelog in Settings for news.</p>',
      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> Can I export analytics?</p><p>A: Not from this section, since it is not yet available.</p>',
