      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> Is the output advice?</p><p>A: No. It is research to inform your own decision.</p>',
      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> Can Centaur Intelligence gather this for me?</p><p>A: Centaur Intelligence is part of the v1.0 launch. Until it opens for your account, follow the steps above.</p>',
