      '<h3>FAQ</h3>',
      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> Can I import a CSV into my personal portfolio?</p><p>A: Not currently. CSV import exists only for organization portfolios. Link a brokerage to import personal holdings.</p>',
      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> If I upload the same file twice, will positions double?</p><p>A: Yes. Each import adds new rows, so upload a corrected file containing only the rows that were skipped.</p>',
