      '<p><strong>Your profile by default.</strong> New accounts start with a public profile, your activity shown in the community feed, and a place on the leaderboard. Your portfolio, trades, holdings and watchlist are hidden by default. Change any of these under Settings, then Profile. More in <a href="/help-center/user/article/privacy-on-profile">Privacy on Your Public Profile</a>.</p>',
      '<p><strong>Opening a real brokerage account.</strong> The Ezana brokerage account is held at Alpaca Securities and needs a US Social Security number or tax ID for identity verification. Plaid bank and brokerage links are available for US institutions.</p>',
