      '<h3>FAQ</h3>',
      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> Will I be charged after I delete my account?</p><p>A: No. Deletion sets your subscription to cancel at the end of the current period, with no further charges.</p>',
      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> Can other members see my holdings?</p><p>A: Not by default. Holdings, trades, portfolio and watchlist stay hidden unless you turn them on in Settings.</p>',
