      '<p>Next in Partner Onboarding: <a href="/help-center/partner/article/becoming-a-partner">How to Become an Ezana Partner</a> and <a href="/help-center/partner/article/verification-and-approval">Partner Verification & Approval Timeline</a>.</p>',
