      '<ul><li><strong>Panel shows names you do not know.</strong> They are sample entries, not real users.</li><li><strong>Numbers never change.</strong> Expected until copy trading launches.</li><li><strong>Want to prepare.</strong> Build an audience through Community and Ezana Echo now.</li><li><strong>Recent Activity mentions copiers.</strong> That panel is also sample data for now.</li></ul>',
      '<p>Next in Partner Dashboard: <a href="/help-center/partner/article/realtime-copier-metrics">How Copier Metrics Update in Real Time</a> and <a href="/help-center/partner/article/growing-copiers">Tips for Growing Your Copier Base</a>.</p>',
      '<h3>Related articles</h3>',
      '<ul><li><a href="/help-center/partner/article/copy-trading-roadmap">Copy Trading Roadmap (Coming Soon)</a></li><li><a href="/help-center/partner/article/how-copiers-are-attributed-to-you">How Copiers Are Attributed to You</a></li><li><a href="/help-center/partner/article/growing-copiers">Tips for Growing Your Copier Base</a></li></ul>',
      '<h3>FAQ</h3>',
      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> Are the Top Copiers real people?</p><p>A: No. The panel shows sample data until copy trading launches.</p>',
      '<p><strong>Q:</strong> How do I keep copiers once it launches?</p><p>A: Consistent process plus prompt, honest communication, especially when a strategy is down.</p>',
